  // returns them and the property editor renders a collapsed "Capital details" section. OFF ⇒ the
  // section is not rendered ⇒ no new writes ⇒ byte-identical position (the read widening is inert on
  // its own: nothing in the money path reads these fields except computeCapitalGain, which only runs on
